          <p>Post copy mode should not be used for critical data, or with unstable networks.</p>
        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      <h2 id="virt-vm-migration-dual-stream_virt-about-live-migration" class="group scroll-mt-20">VM migration support for RHCOS 10.x<a href="#virt-vm-migration-dual-stream_virt-about-live-migration" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
